WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Traction is launching itself, on its own board. The current focus: prove demand.

00:03.500 --> 00:07.700
Why this focus? Next proof: a first visitor from the launch, and one enquiry followed through.

00:07.700 --> 00:11.900
A missed commitment stays marked missed. A result not yet recorded says so.

00:11.900 --> 00:16.600
The destination and the counts that would prove it. Every count starts at zero, in the open.

00:16.600 --> 00:21.300
Each initiative names the outcome it works towards and its next dated action.
